    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">EverWorld is a procedurally generated life sim with deeply simulated artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Randomised world</strong> - deeply detailed and uniquely generated for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>NPCs with personality</strong> - NPCs that have goals, personality, opinions and memory - they make decisions and talk to each other about real things in the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Everything is a thing</strong> - if you can see it, it's real and you can interact with it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Deep simulation</strong>  - the world progresses whether the player engages or not</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Life simulation</strong> - NPCs actually go to work, actually do jobs and fulfil their own day to day wants and needs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Free text dialogue</strong> - say anything to NPCs (current contextual understanding is limited but growing every update - they might not understand everything but they'll try!) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Dynamic quests</strong> - Daily quests plus NPCs will raise their own quest based on real wants and needs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Dynamic crafting</strong> - Discover recipes and use any material with the right properties to craft items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>No loading screens</strong> - Building interiors are no different from the world outside</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">EverWorld is a procedurally generated life sim with deeply simulated artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Randomised world</strong> - deeply detailed and uniquely generated for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>NPCs with personality</strong> - NPCs that have goals, personality, opinions and memory - they make decisions and talk to each other about real things in the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Everything is a thing</strong> - if you can see it, it's real and you can interact with it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Deep simulation</strong>  - the world progresses whether the player engages or not</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Life simulation</strong> - NPCs actually go to work, actually do jobs and fulfil their own day to day wants and needs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Free text dialogue</strong> - say anything to NPCs (current contextual understanding is limited but growing every update - they might not understand everything but they'll try!) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Dynamic quests</strong> - Daily quests plus NPCs will raise their own quest based on real wants and needs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Dynamic crafting</strong> - Discover recipes and use any material with the right properties to craft items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>No loading screens</strong> - Building interiors are no different from the world outside</p>",
